stateDiagram-v2

    [*] --> CREATED

    CREATED --> BLOCKED: dependencies exist
    CREATED --> PENDING: no dependencies

    BLOCKED --> PENDING: all parents succeeded
    BLOCKED --> SKIPPED: dependency failed

    PENDING --> DISPATCHED: worker reserved
    DISPATCHED --> RUNNING: TaskAccepted

    RUNNING --> SUCCEEDED
    RUNNING --> FAILED
    RUNNING --> LOST
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED

    FAILED --> PENDING: retry budget available
    LOST --> PENDING: retry budget available

    SUCCEEDED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
    SKIPPED --> [*]
